@startuml organization-operations-boundary
title Organization / Operations Boundary ; per CR-ES-022 section 11

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Organization" as Org
class "Operations" as Op

Org --> Op : operates within
Org -[dotted]- Op : is NOT
Op -[dotted]- Org : is NOT

note right
  Per CR-ES-022 section 11:
  Organization operates within Operations boundary. An
  Organization may operate through Operations, but an
  Organization is NOT Operations.
end note

@enduml
